synodicae mitterentur, 165.</ITEM> <ITEM>Quid in iis contineretur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Quo fine mitterentur,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Quorum pontificum habeantur, 166.</ITEM> <ITEM>Synodica Gelasii,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ibid.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>Pelagii I, 167.</ITEM> <ITEM>Gregorii
