charum, ac deinde constitutum comitem Parisiensem.</NOTE> , sive Bero <NOTE N="f" TYPE="foot" ANCHORED=Y COM="0579" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0579D"></COL> Uti Eginhardus in Vita Caroli Magni auctor est,
